    {
     "planLine": "medium — Sarah, Herr Brunner — Sarah stands in the narrow passage gesturing at a suit of armour and talking at Herr Brunner, who faces her, unable to pass — the others have time to reach the back door while Herr Brunner is held",
     "pageNumber": 4
    },
    {
     "planLine": "ultra-wide — Seeschwalbe — the Seeschwalbe glides out of the fog on the Limmat toward the river bank, her old hull and rigging emerging from grey mist, no people in frame — the pirate ship exists and has come for the chart",
     "pageNumber": 5
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Fiona, Facundo, Sarah, Saira, Lorena, Herr Brunner — Facundo hauls Sarah over the ship's rail one step ahead of Herr Brunner's reaching hand, the others already aboard — the five friends are aboard the Seeschwalbe",
     "pageNumber": 6
    },
    {
     "planLine": "close-up — Fiona, Facundo — Facundo's open hand reaches toward Fiona, who grips Kapitän Zollingers Seekarte against her chest with one hand and pulls back her sailcloth sash with the other — Fiona refuses; the sash and the chart both stay with her",
     "pageNumber": 7
    },
    {
     "planLine": "low-angle — Facundo — a loose flap of his costume slapping across his face, Facundo braces under the falling mast and catches it on his shoulders so it does not strike anyone — the mast is down safely but its yard tip strikes the bridge and breaks away",
     "pageNumber": 8
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Saira, Facundo — Saira grips an oar, her body checked for one instant against the pull of the current, then leans hard into the stroke as Facundo rows beside her — the crew reach the Lindenhof wall before sunset",
     "pageNumber": 9
    },
    {
     "planLine": "high-angle — Herr Brunner, Fiona — looking down from the Lindenhof, Herr Brunner stands at the top of the steps to the landing while far below Fiona stands on the deck of the Seeschwalbe pressed against the smooth wall, the marked stone high above her reach — the wall is smooth and the deck lies too far below the stone; Herr Brunner is closing in",
     "pageNumber": 10
    },
    {
     "planLine": "medium — Fiona — Fiona drives her sewing scissors into the fabric of her own coat and cuts it into strips, her face set, the sash still at her waist — the coat-rope exists; something Fiona valued is spent",
     "pageNumber": 11
    },
    {
     "planLine": "over-the-shoulder — Facundo, Fiona, Pfeffer — from behind Facundo bracing at the rail, Fiona presses both hands flat against the smooth wall while Pfeffer perches on the iron ring above, the knotted coat-rope looped through it — Fiona is on the wall; the rope is threaded and she can climb",
     "pageNumber": 12
    },
