     "planLine": "medium — Lorena, Herr Brunner — Lorena holds the chart behind her back and faces Herr Brunner, who reaches toward her, the crew standing between them — Herr Brunner cannot take the chart; the crew obey Lorena",
     "pageNumber": 13
